        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">More about Stryker’s Journey to Zero harm</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alongside The Joint Commission, a nonprofit committed to quality improvement and patient safety in healthcare, Stryker has committed to several zero goals in the operating room: blind spots, surgical smoke, retained surgical sponges, drug diversion, splashes and spills, and slips, trips and falls – known collectively as the “Journey to Zero*” harm across the continuum of care.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Did you know?<br>\n </span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"></span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 18 2023 16:59:36 GMT+0000",
        "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
        "textIsRich": "true",
