        "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Operating rooms generate<br>\n </span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\">up to 70%</span> <span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\">of the total waste&nbsp;</span><br>\n </span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">produced in hospitals.<sup>2</sup></span></span></p>\n",
