        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Open waste management systems require</span><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">&nbsp;<br>\n </span></span></span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">nearly 3.5 times</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">as much staff time&nbsp;</span><br>\n </span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">for setup and maintenance during procedures and post-procedure waste disposal.<sup>4</sup></span></span></span></span></p>\n",
