        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(133, 69, 138);\">Neptune was pioneered <br>\n by an OR nurse.&nbsp;</span><br>\n </span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">In 2001 we launched the first-generation Neptune fluid and smoke waste management system as the only constantly closed waste management system on the market.</span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
